```mdl
verdict SetSimulatedParticipants: The operation hands participants and transcript to CallManager.simulate, which plays them locally.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/types/CallOperation.ts#SetSimulatedParticipants, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/operations/set-simulated-participants.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/calls/call-manager.ts#CallManager.simulate, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/calls/call-simulation.ts#CallSimulation]
  walkthrough:
    - The operation declares participants (src, screenshare, avatar) and timed transcript lines. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/types/CallOperation.ts#SetSimulatedParticipants
    - The handler forwards them to CallManager.simulate, clearing on an empty list. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/operations/set-simulated-participants.ts
    - CallManager keeps join local while simulated and emits simulatedUtterance for each line. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-calls/src/calls/call-manager.ts#CallManager.simulate
  note: The SimulatedCall story calls `CallManager.simulate` directly and plugin-meeting's autocue drives the operation, but no test invokes it.
```

